### GET TOP SCORES
GET http://localhost:8080/api/score/nonogram
Accept: application/json

###

### ADD SCORE
POST http://localhost:8080/api/score
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "player": "tester",
  "game": "nonogram",
  "points": 150,
  "playedOn": "2025-04-09"
}

###

### GET COMMENTS
GET http://localhost:8080/api/comment/nonogram
Accept: application/json

###

### ADD COMMENT
POST http://localhost:8080/api/comment
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "player": "tester",
  "game": "nonogram",
  "comment": "Fun game!",
  "commentedOn": "2025-04-09"
}

###

### GET AVERAGE RATING
GET http://localhost:8080/api/rating/nonogram
Accept: application/json

###

### GET PLAYER RATING
GET http://localhost:8080/api/rating/nonogram/tester
Accept: application/json

###

### SET RATING
POST http://localhost:8080/api/rating
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "player": "tester",
  "game": "nonogram",
  "rating": 5,
  "ratedOn": "2025-04-09"
}
